{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669380/extras/Welcome.png?t=1741259498\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Towns of Yore is a relaxing third-person city-builder situated on enchanting sky islands. Manage resources, create ecosystems, and build a thriving environment for your cheerful and curious inhabitants. Plan, care, grow, and watch your fantasy town come to life!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669380/extras/Build.png?t=1741259498\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Construct everything from modest homes to impressive landmarks like taverns, farms, and observatories. Each building unlocks new opportunities for growth, transforming your town into a lively, thriving community. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669380/extras/PlacingCookingStation.gif?t=1741259498\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669380/extras/GatherResources.png?t=1741259498\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather resources, earn money, and spend research points to unlock new workstations and advancements. Strategically manage your research to determine in what order you expand your product line and town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669380/extras/ChoppingTrees.gif?t=1741259498\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669380/extras/Production_management.png?t=1741259498\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build efficient production chains by connecting workstations, assigning couriers, and laying down roads to streamline travel. Automate processes and optimize workflows, but keep your inhabitants happy to ensure everything runs smoothly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669380/extras/LayingPathsGif.gif?t=1741259498\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669380/extras/Happiness.png?t=1741259498\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Decorate your inhabitants' homes with cozy touches like windows, plants, and lights to enhance the atmosphere and entertainment value on your island. The happier your inhabitants are, the more attractive your town becomes, drawing in even more visitors!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669380/extras/Decorating.gif?t=1741259498\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Have a great day and see you soon in Towns of Yore!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669380/extras/Wave_gif.gif?t=1741259498\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1669380?t=1741259498","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669380/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741259498","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669380/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741259498","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a